  "body_html": "<p>Transform your space with the Custom Footballer on Fire Comforter Set from Jeminise, designed to bring the vibrant spirit of the game into your bedroom. Perfect for sports fans, players, and coaches, this custom bedding set offers an eye-catching design paired with cozy, breathable warmth. Whether you are looking for a lightweight duvet cover or an all-in-one comforter, this bedding serves as a stylish sports-themed decor piece and a thoughtful personalized gift for birthdays, holidays, or special celebrations.</p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customization options are supported with 2 text inputs, allowing you to personalize the bedding with a name and number.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Premium Material Details:</strong> Crafted from 100% brushed polyester fabric, offering a soft, lightweight, and durable texture.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Cozy Comforter &amp; Duvet Options:</strong> Choose between a lightweight duvet cover with a hidden zipper closure (no insert included) or a thick, all-in-one comforter with a warm, non-clumping microfiber fill.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> Each package features 1 Duvet Cover (or Comforter) and optional matching sports pillowcases to complete the theme.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Perfectly sized for US beds, including Twin (68\" x 88\"), Full (78\" x 88\"), Queen (88\" x 88\"), and King (104\" x 88\").</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water on a gentle cycle; air dry or tumble dry on low heat for quick, fluffy results.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Brushed Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Footballer on Fire</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Football / Sports</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All Seasons</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine wash cold, tumble dry low</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
